    "It misses third-party application caches (Discord, Spotify, Steam, Chrome Service Workers), does not uninstall leftover app files, and has no file shredding or duplicate photo detection.": "Es übersieht Caches von Drittanbieter-Apps (Discord, Spotify, Steam, Chrome Service Workers), entfernt keine Programmreste und bietet weder Dateischredder noch Duplikaterkennung.",
